==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|innumérable|lang=fr}} < {{etyl|la}} {{term|innumerabilis|lang=la}} < {{prefix|in|numerabilis|lang=la}} . Derived from [[in-]] prefix and [[numerable]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{SAMPA|1=/%In."nu:.mr=.@.bl=/}}
* {{audio|En-us-innumerable.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not capable of being [[counted]], [[enumerated]], or [[numbered]], hence, indefinitely numerous; of great number.

====Synonyms====
* [[countless]]
* [[numberless]]
* [[unnumbered]]

